    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/6f2e9d079c046e833f8372693885a96f.poster.avif?t=1682697673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/6f2e9d079c046e833f8372693885a96f.webm?t=1682697673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/6f2e9d079c046e833f8372693885a96f.mp4?t=1682697673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Help a little blue pill liberate their homeland one flag at a time, in this puzzle-platformer that is all about turning the elements of the level in your favor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 20 levels of increasing difficulty that will test both your puzzle-solving and platforming skills<br></li><li> Discover new tools as you progress, and learn how to use them to reach your goals<br></li><li> Simple and accessible controls; it's all about using what's available in each unique challenge<br></li><li> Test your mastery with Time-Attack mode; beat every level under a strict time limit for a rare achievement</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/a4fe93b625fbd401c53c57c3d224745d.webp?t=1682697673\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/6f2e9d079c046e833f8372693885a96f.poster.avif?t=1682697673\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/6f2e9d079c046e833f8372693885a96f.webm?t=1682697673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/6f2e9d079c046e833f8372693885a96f.mp4?t=1682697673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Help a little blue pill liberate their homeland one flag at a time, in this puzzle-platformer that is all about turning the elements of the level in your favor.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 20 levels of increasing difficulty that will test both your puzzle-solving and platforming skills<br></li><li> Discover new tools as you progress, and learn how to use them to reach your goals<br></li><li> Simple and accessible controls; it's all about using what's available in each unique challenge<br></li><li> Test your mastery with Time-Attack mode; beat every level under a strict time limit for a rare achievement</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2326410/extras/a4fe93b625fbd401c53c57c3d224745d.webp?t=1682697673\" /></span>",
    "short_description": "Think smart and run fast! A clever puzzle-platformer where you must solve how to reach all flags quickly before it is too late. You will learn how to arrange the elements of each level into a path for you to rush through and secure the last flag just in time.",
